{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Layouts",
                  "field": "layouts",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "font_usage_layouts",
                      "params": {
                        "many": ""
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Layouts with many fonts",
                  "field": "many_layouts",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "font_usage_layouts",
                      "params": {
                        "many": "1"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "toggle": true
                },
                {
                  "label": "Matching font uses",
                  "field": "uses",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Files",
                  "field": "files",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Slider",
            "id": "font_max_slider",
            "props": {
              "param": "font_max",
              "label": "Many fonts",
              "comparator": ">",
              "min": 1,
              "max": 10,
              "step": 1,
              "default": 3,
              "valueSuffix": " fonts"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "filter_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "id": "filter_row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 12,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "id": "search_input",
                "props": {
                  "param": "search",
                  "placeholder": "Search font, layout, object or field…",
                  "width": 30,
                  "resetParams": [
                    "layouts_page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "file_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "file_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All files",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "resetParams": [
                    "layouts_page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "theme_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "theme_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "theme",
                  "label": "Theme",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All themes",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "separator": "|",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "layouts_page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "font_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "font_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "font",
                  "label": "Font",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All fonts",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "separator": "|",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "layouts_page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "size_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "size_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "size",
                  "label": "Size",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All sizes",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "separator": "|",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "layouts_page"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "FilterChips",
            "id": "source_chips",
            "props": {
              "param": "source",
              "default": "",
              "resetParams": [
                "layouts_page"
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "",
                  "label": "With a font name",
                  "countField": "chip_src_named"
                },
                {
                  "value": "local",
                  "label": "Local",
                  "countField": "chip_src_local"
                },
                {
                  "value": "local_redundant",
                  "label": "Local, same as inherited",
                  "countField": "chip_src_local_redundant"
                },
                {
                  "value": "style",
                  "label": "Style",
                  "countField": "chip_src_style"
                },
                {
                  "value": "theme",
                  "label": "Theme",
                  "countField": "chip_src_theme"
                },
                {
                  "value": "rich_text",
                  "label": "Rich text",
                  "countField": "chip_src_rich_text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "chart",
                  "label": "Chart",
                  "countField": "chip_src_chart"
                },
                {
                  "value": "default",
                  "label": "File default",
                  "countField": "chip_src_default"
                },
                {
                  "value": "all",
                  "label": "All sources",
                  "countField": "chip_src_all"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "FilterChips",
            "id": "otype_chips",
            "props": {
              "param": "otype",
              "default": "",
              "resetParams": [
                "layouts_page"
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "",
                  "label": "All",
                  "countField": "chip_all"
                },
                {
                  "value": "text",
                  "label": "Text",
                  "countField": "chip_text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "field",
                  "label": "Field",
                  "countField": "chip_field"
                },
                {
                  "value": "dropdown",
                  "label": "Drop-down list",
                  "countField": "chip_dropdown"
                },
                {
                  "value": "popup",
                  "label": "Pop-up menu",
                  "countField": "chip_popup"
                },
                {
                  "value": "checkbox",
                  "label": "Checkbox set",
                  "countField": "chip_checkbox"
                },
                {
                  "value": "radio",
                  "label": "Radio buttons",
                  "countField": "chip_radio"
                },
                {
                  "value": "calendar",
                  "label": "Calendar",
                  "countField": "chip_calendar"
                },
                {
                  "value": "button",
                  "label": "Button",
                  "countField": "chip_button"
                },
                {
                  "value": "tab",
                  "label": "Tab control",
                  "countField": "chip_tab"
                },
                {
                  "value": "chart",
                  "label": "Chart",
                  "countField": "chip_chart"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "layouts_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Layouts",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "layouts"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "layouts_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": false,
              "pageParam": "layouts_page",
              "sortParam": "layouts_sort",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "file_name",
                  "label": "File",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "layout_name",
                  "label": "Layout",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "theme",
                  "label": "Theme"
                },
                {
                  "field": "fonts",
                  "label": "Fonts",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "font_list",
                  "label": "Named fonts"
                },
                {
                  "field": "hits",
                  "label": "Matching uses",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "default_objects",
                  "label": "Objects without a named font",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "count"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "font_usage_objects",
                  "layout_uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "layout_file": "{{file_name}}",
                  "search": "{{_carry_search}}",
                  "file": "{{_carry_file}}",
                  "theme": "{{_carry_theme}}",
                  "font": "{{_carry_font}}",
                  "size": "{{_carry_size}}",
                  "source": "{{_carry_source}}",
                  "otype": "{{_carry_otype}}"
                }
              },
              "rowAction": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "Layout",
                  "file": "{{file_name}}",
                  "marks": "{{_marks}}"
                }
              },
              "rowActionLabel": "Show in layout",
              "empty": {
                "message": "No layout in this selection."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "How to read the list",
          "collapsible": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "notes_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "**Filters and columns.** The filters, chips and the search decide *which* layouts appear: a layout is listed when at least one of its font uses matches. *Matching uses* counts those uses. The font columns always describe the whole layout: *Fonts* and *Named fonts* are the fonts its objects name, *Objects without a named font* are the objects whose font is left to the file default.\n\n**File default.** The theme names no font (Classic, Minimalist), so FileMaker uses a default of the file that the XML export does not contain. The file default is no font: it counts in neither *Fonts* nor *many fonts*. By default the list counts only uses with a font name; the chip *File default* lists the layouts with such objects.\n\n**Navigation.** A click on a row opens the objects of the layout with the same filters; the arrow opens the layout with the matching objects marked (at most 200)."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
